   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_11"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I have a gig on Friday and I'm losing my voice. Panicking slightly.",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 0.4,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "music.dlg10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Okay, first, rest your voice as much as you can. That means not whispering either, whispering actually strains it.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.58,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "music.dlg10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Not even whispering? Wow.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.22,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "music.dlg10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Afraid so. Drink lots of water, breathe steam from a bowl of hot water, and try to sleep a lot.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.64,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "music.dlg10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Should I cancel? I",
